{"id":"c26","stage":4,"title":"便利与隐私","scene":"讨论数据使用的边界。","roles":["敏智","你"],"lines":[{"id":"c26-1","ko":"맞춤형 서비스는 편리한 만큼 정보를 많이 요구하죠.","zh":"个性化服务提供便利的同时，也要求大量信息。","note":"만큼 在这里表达与便利相伴的信息要求，并不是在断言严格的“越……越……”因果规律。","words":[{"term":"맞춤형","zh":"定制型","id":"ea01c61925aee242","audio":"/audio/ea01c61925aee242a4d3.mp3"},{"term":"편리하다","zh":"便利","id":"06221da4281e2016","audio":"/audio/06221da4281e2016e193.mp3"},{"term":"요구하다","zh":"要求","id":"1d2e00f218da4a4e","audio":"/audio/1d2e00f218da4a4e42cd.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/de71621919a028b5f9df.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"맞춤형","meaning":"个性化","explanation":"맞춤형指按使用者需要定制的类型。","readings":[{"term":"맞춤형","audio":"/audio/ea01c61925aee242a4d3.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞춤형","audio":"/audio/ea01c61925aee242a4d3.mp3"}},{"text":"서비스는","meaning":"服务","explanation":"서비스（服务）+ 는（话题）。","readings":[{"term":"서비스는","audio":"/audio/31174c6c8766eb427184.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서비스는","audio":"/audio/31174c6c8766eb427184.mp3"}},{"text":"편리한","meaning":"便利的","explanation":"편리하다（便利）+ -ㄴ（定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"편리하다","audio":"/audio/06221da4281e2016e193.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"편리한","audio":"/audio/3bd709914d464ca41979.mp3"}},{"text":"만큼","meaning":"与之相应地","explanation":"만큼表示相应的程度；此处不必理解为严格的“越……越……”因果关系。","readings":[{"term":"만큼","audio":"/audio/85c802d46593624b33b4.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만큼","audio":"/audio/85c802d46593624b33b4.mp3"}},{"text":"정보를","meaning":"信息","explanation":"정보（信息）+ 를（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"정보를","audio":"/audio/e0f003b0d98f430a3858.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정보를","audio":"/audio/e0f003b0d98f430a3858.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"大量","explanation":"많이表示数量多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"요구하죠.","meaning":"要求","explanation":"요구하다（要求）+ -지요 → 요구하죠（确认共同认识）。","readings":[{"term":"요구하다","audio":"/audio/1d2e00f218da4a4e42cd.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요구