}]},{"id":"c26-3","ko":"동의 버튼을 눌렀다고 해서 충분히 이해한 건 아니에요.","zh":"按了同意按钮，并不意味着已经充分理解。","note":"-다고 해서…것은 아니다：不能因为……就认为……。","words":[{"term":"동의","zh":"同意","id":"051a33c2b3a71197","audio":"/audio/051a33c2b3a71197783e.mp3"},{"term":"충분히","zh":"充分地","id":"06bc7ba2a51ddf11","audio":"/audio/06bc7ba2a51ddf11ed20.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/08e1a9d931cd585bfd85.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"동의","meaning":"同意","explanation":"동의修饰버튼，组成“同意按钮”。","readings":[{"term":"동의","audio":"/audio/051a33c2b3a71197783e.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동의","audio":"/audio/051a33c2b3a71197783e.mp3"}},{"text":"버튼을","meaning":"按钮","explanation":"버튼（按钮）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"버튼을","audio":"/audio/7747c550e0838f17c0f8.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버튼을","audio":"/audio/7747c550e0838f17c0f8.mp3"}},{"text":"눌렀다고","meaning":"按了","explanation":"누르다（按）→ 눌렀다（过去，르不规则）+ -고（引用连接）。","readings":[{"term":"눌렀다고","audio":"/audio/d5163173d43160a02586.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눌렀다고","audio":"/audio/d5163173d43160a02586.mp3"}},{"text":"해서","meaning":"就因为","explanation":"하다 + -여서 → 해서；-다고 해서引出“仅因为……”。","readings":[{"term":"해서","audio":"/audio/91cbeb2e0a1193dc2da9.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해서","audio":"/audio/91cbeb2e0a1193dc2da9.mp3"}},{"text":"충분히","meaning":"充分地","explanation":"충분히修饰理解程度。","readings":[{"term":"충분히","audio":"/audio/06bc7ba2a51ddf11ed20.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"충분히","audio":"/audio/06bc7ba2a51ddf11ed20.mp3"}},{"text":"이해한","meaning":"理解了的","explanation":"이해하다（理解）+ -ㄴ（过去定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"이해한","audio":"/audio/917f9f21ba685082d31a.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이해한","audio":"/audio/917f9f21ba685082d31a.mp3"}},{"text":"건","meaning":"这件事","explanation":"것은的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"건","audio":"/audio/f5fd44f22ad30ad631dc.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건","audio":"/audio/f5fd44f22ad30ad631dc.mp3"}},{"text":"아니에요.","meaning":"并不是","explanation":"아니다（不是）的礼貌形式；整个句型否定由前项直接推论后项。","readings":[{"term":"아니에요","audio":"/audio/2a86f32067c011ee9805.mp3"}],"surfaceRead